================================================================================================================
PART 0 -- THE GATE CHECKLIST: what a passing Lagrangian must satisfy (with the encoding obstruction).
================================================================================================================
    [G1  DOF/ghost] REQUIRE: no wrong-sign kinetic mode; any extra scalar has a right-sign, non-strongly-coupled kinetic term
          obstruction/status: CAM liberates the conformal ghost H0=-p^2/12M^2<0 (L117); KGB scalar C00<0 at y>=2
    [G2  constraint closure] REQUIRE: the full Dirac algebra closes (terminates + consistent); DOF count stable across k
          obstruction/status: CAM terminates but H_perp second-class w/ ghost (L116/L117); DOF discontinuity at k=0
    [G3  elliptic/hyperbolic] REQUIRE: the lapse constraint stays ELLIPTIC and the scalar HYPERBOLIC across ALL accelerations y
          obstruction/status: CAM lapse nonelliptic y>1 (L115/L116); KGB hyperbolicity fails y>=2
    [G4  c_T = c] REQUIRE: tensor (graviton) speed = c (GW170817)
          obstruction/status: F(Q)Theta passes (L88); a generic constraint, easy to satisfy
    [G5  PPN gamma=1] REQUIRE: no-slip / light-bending gamma=1 (Cassini |gamma-1|<2.3e-5)
          obstruction/status: static no-slip Phi=Psi gives gamma=1 (L108/L112); STANDS
    [G6  PPN beta + alpha_i] REQUIRE: beta, alpha_1,alpha_2,alpha_3 within bounds (needs the 2nd-order/moving-frame solve)
          obstruction/status: AeST died on alpha_1=-2(K_B+2) (L91); CAM beta/alpha undetermined (L115)
    [G7  deep-MOND + BTFR] REQUIRE: recovers v_c^4 = G M a0 (mass-DEPENDENT flat speed) + a smooth interpolation
          obstruction/status: KGB fixed power w=1/(2n+1) gives ONE flat speed => no BTFR (astra)
    [G8  cosmology] REQUIRE: healthy FLRW + perturbations; CMB acoustic peaks + clusters (dark component or mechanism)
          obstruction/status: CAM pure-MOND => no dark sector => CMB/cluster challenge (L110); conformal ghost in homogeneous sector (L117)
    [G9  BBN] REQUIRE: no intrinsic fine-tuning of the dark/stiff sector
          obstruction/status: old F(Q)Theta dust forces stiff => ~24-order tuning (L87); CAM has none but no dark matter (L110)
    [G10 a0 coefficient] REQUIRE: the a0 = c^2/(2 pi L_dS) coefficient DERIVED, not fitted
          obstruction/status: kappa=1/2 provably underivable to date (k01-k03); STILL FITTED
  [PASS] SPEC-1  the gate checklist G1-G10 is itemized, each with the physical requirement and the obstruction it encodes (and which lane established it) -- a single actionable target for the Lagrangian search   (10 gates specified (G1 ghost ... G10 a0 coefficient))

